# Column chooser: show, hide, reorder and resize columns (F4)
Output "tui-08-columns.gif"
Output "raw/tui-08-columns.mp4"
Source "../tapes/_setup.tape"
Sleep 800ms
# open: the control opens here (compose4.py syncs the 2x2 clips on it)
Ctrl+K
Type "columns"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Down 3
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot "raw/tui-08-columns.png"
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms
